{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §4.2, [TSON-SCHEMA] §5.7"
  description: """
    The same rule over a reference that names values. `text` is neither `order` nor IS-A it, so `texts` would
    admit names `orders` refuses, and a refinement replacing `of` with an unrelated type is no narrowing.
    """
  error: {
    category: resolver
  }
}
